1
00:00:00,930 --> 00:00:03,350
(Sheldon:)overnight guest
notification clause.

2
00:00:03,350 --> 00:00:06,220
(Leonard:)Okay, fine,
I-I'm a horrible human being.

3
00:00:06,220 --> 00:00:08,320
(Leonard:)I'm the Darth Vader of Pasadena.

4
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:11,020
(Sheldon:)You're far too short
to be Darth Vader.

5
00:00:11,940 --> 00:00:14,860
(Sheldon:)At best you might be
a turncoat Ewok.

6
00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:18,260
My point is: Priya's gone
and it would be much better

7
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:20,950
if no one else found out
about us.

8
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:23,830
(Sheldon:)You mean you want me
to keep a secret?

9
00:00:23,830 --> 00:00:24,870
(Howard:)Yes.

10
00:00:24,870 --> 00:00:26,540
(Sheldon:)You know I can't
keep a secret.

11
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:27,600
(Leonard:)You can if you try.

12
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:28,840
(Leonard:)Think about
it this way:

13
00:00:28,840 --> 00:00:31,740
um, if I were Batman
and you were Alfred,

14
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:33,680
(Leonard:)you'd keep that
secret, right?

15
00:00:33,680 --> 00:00:36,460
(Sheldon:)Why do you get
to be Batman?

16
00:00:36,460 --> 00:00:38,600
Because Batman has the secret.

17
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:40,430
(Sheldon:)Alfred has secrets, too.

18
00:00:40,430 --> 00:00:42,020
(Leonard:)Like what?
Alfred knows

19
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:44,320
(Sheldon:)that Barbara Gordon
is Batgirl.

20
00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:45,800
(Sheldon:)Which I've now just
told to Batman.

21
00:00:45,810 --> 00:00:48,140
See, I cannot
keep a secret.

22
00:00:51,630 --> 00:00:53,360
Ta-dah!

23
00:00:53,360 --> 00:00:54,400
(Sheldon:)What?

24
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:56,830
Ta-dah.

25
00:00:56,830 --> 00:00:57,770
(Sheldon:)It's short for...

26
00:00:57,770 --> 00:00:59,740
♪ Da-da-da-da! ♪

27
00:00:59,740 --> 00:01:02,370
(Leonard:)Kind of busy here, Sheldon.

